€¢ Should have the capability to resolve all the doubts and Handling query sessions for the students;
€¢ Should have practical knowledge about all the social media platforms.
€¢ Planning and preparing courses and lessons for digital marketing.
€¢ Ability to conduct training programs, workshops or delivering talks on Digital concepts.
€¢ Should be able to update the curriculum and ppt as and when required.

